{"unit_id":"AKS1st__dsh-cyber-particle#card-zh","repo":"AKS1st/dsh-cyber-particle","commit":"e08111d59df009454d9de6b8384907f697e038f6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"cyber-particle 是面向 DSH Web 的界面插件，在全屏覆盖层中绘制持续运动并相互连线的粒子网络，且覆盖层不拦截页面交互。它注册 shell.overlay 和 settings.section，在“粒子背景”设置页提供粒子数量、半径、线宽、连线距离、速度及粒子和线条颜色调节，并可即时重置。设置保存在浏览器 localStorage，刷新后恢复；界面支持中文和英文。适合希望调整 DSH Web 背景效果的用户；无需 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:150-435"]}
{"unit_id":"AKS1st__dsh-cyber-particle#card-en","repo":"AKS1st/dsh-cyber-particle","commit":"e08111d59df009454d9de6b8384907f697e038f6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"cyber-particle adds an animated particle network to DSH Web in a full-screen, non-blocking overlay. Its settings page adjusts particle count, size, speed, links, and colors, with live updates and reset. Preferences persist in browser storage; the UI supports Chinese and English.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:150-435"]}
